[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0001","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0001","title":"FreeBSD/OpenBSD TCP/IP 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 及 OpenBSD 等 BSD 衍生系统 TCP/IP 协议栈实现中的 ip_input.c 文件存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20），远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标系统发送特制的网络数据包触发该漏洞，导致目标系统内核崩溃或死锁，进而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD、OpenBSD 等多个 BSD 衍生操作系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。建议升级至修复版本或应用厂商发布的安全补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0001"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:13Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 2.2.8 或 3.0 及以上版本，OpenBSD 升级至 2.4 及以上版本。临时缓解措施可在边界防火墙上过滤畸形 IP 分片包，或禁用不必要的 raw socket 处理功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openbsd.org/errata23.html#tcpfix","http://www.osvdb.org/5707","https://github.com/MarcusGutierrez/complex-vulnerabilities"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-2006","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-2006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1573","title":"HP HP-UX r-cmnds 远程命令服务多重权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 的 r-cmnds 远程命令套件（包括 remshd、rexecd、rlogind、rlogin、remsh、rcp、rexec、rdist 等 8 个组件）存在多个未公开的安全漏洞。攻击者可利用这些漏洞提升权限或非法访问系统文件，影响 HP-UX 10.00 至 11.00 版本。由于漏洞细节未公开且 CVSS 评分为 10.0（严重），实际利用风险极高，建议立即升级或禁用相关 r-command 服务。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1573"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:44Z","remediation":"升级至不受影响版本或安装对应累积补丁：HP-UX 10.00/10.01/10.10 安装 PHNE_13618，10.20/10.30 安装 PHNE_13619，11.00 安装 PHNE_16091。同时禁用 r-commands 相关服务（remshd、rexecd、rlogind、rdist），改用 SSH 进行远程管理；在防火墙上限制 513/tcp（rlogin）、514/tcp（rsh）、514/udp（rdist）端口的入站访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.auscert.org.au/render.html?it=490","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-022.shtml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/13217","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/1471","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7860","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A5550","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1573.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1573","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1573.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2658816172d77941b1080be8784997934e564ee9/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1573.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-85gv-g5rc-fxqg/GHSA-85gv-g5rc-fxqg.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/h/hpux_PHNE_16091.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000969.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9099e2c0-f5ec-4b3e-b8b9-c95ef05da613.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1573.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-2006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0200","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0477","title":"Allaire ColdFusion 应用服务器远程文件上传漏洞","description":"ColdFusion Application Server 的表达式求值器（Expression Evaluator）存在访问控制缺陷，远程攻击者可通过 openfile.cfm 脚本绕过权限限制，向目标服务器上传任意文件，进而实现远程文件显示、删除、上传与执行。该漏洞影响 Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.0 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，且利用代码已公开，实际威胁较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0477"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:28Z","remediation":"升级至 Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.0.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 openfile.cfm 的权限验证缺陷。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面限制对 openfile.cfm 的访问，仅允许受信 IP 或移除该文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/115","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19093"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0200.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0200.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0198","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0455","title":"Allaire ColdFusion 表达式评估器任意文件读取删除漏洞","description":"ColdFusion 服务器自带的 Expression Evaluator 示例应用（exprcalc.cfm）存在未授权访问漏洞。由于该示例页面未对访问权限进行适当限制，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可直接访问该页面，利用表达式评估功能读取或删除服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Adobe ColdFusion 多个版本，攻击者仅需知道目标服务器地址即可实施攻击，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0455"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:26Z","remediation":"删除 ColdFusion 服务器 webroot 下的 `CFIDE/exprcalc.cfm` 及整个示例应用目录，或升级到不受影响的 ColdFusion 版本（4.0 以上）。生产环境应移除所有示例应用文件，并通过 Web 服务器配置限制对 `/CFIDE/` 目录的访问。如无法立即修复，可在防火墙或 WAF 层面拦截对 `exprcalc.cfm` 的请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/115","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1231f6f5f21cc87f3264c90adadd01cbb12e76ba/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0455.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0455","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0455.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/77fd3cf167afc5c82646a191836bcd2f9e51b459/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0455.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/18de81c56daca1c9e33223f0b95bdb8312a1ca75/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-68jc-r2qv-937x/GHSA-68jc-r2qv-937x.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-coldfusion.rules","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0455.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/ColdFusion.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0687","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0687.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0892","title":"Netscape Communicator 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.7 之前版本在处理动态字体时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当字体长度字段值小于实际字体大小时，程序未能正确验证字体数据长度，导致堆或栈缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的动态字体文件，诱使用户在受影响浏览器中打开恶意网页触发该漏洞，可能导致拒绝服务或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Netscape Communicator 4.7 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0892"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:16Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Netscape Communicator 至 4.7 或更高版本（如 Netscape 6.x/7.x 或 Mozilla Suite）。若无法立即升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用动态字体下载功能（Edit → Preferences → Fonts → 取消勾选 \"Allow documents to use other fonts\"），或通过防火墙/代理层面拦截 .pfr/.eot 字体文件下载作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快迁移至现代浏览器（Firefox/Chrome/Edge）彻底规避该漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0892","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0892.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8d0ba8eaeba3ff3558e6044a19d5b454dcc12f33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0892.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0892","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/512c773c61886081b2589de76a8cfde795349819/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0892.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0892.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3jvw-9ph4-qc53/GHSA-3jvw-9ph4-qc53.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0892.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153800_153900.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0687.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0949","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0949.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1109","title":"Sendmail 8.10.0 ETRN 命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.10.0 及之前版本在处理 SMTP ETRN 命令时存在缺陷，远程攻击者可发送一系列 ETRN 命令后主动断开连接，而 Sendmail 进程仍在后台继续处理这些命令，导致资源耗尽引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Sendmail 8.10.0 之前版本（含 8.9.1/8.9.3 等），CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），攻击无需身份认证，仅需网络访问 SMTP 端口即可发起攻击，利用方式为发送多条 ETRN 命令后断开 TCP 连接，导致服务器持续消耗资源处理已断连的命令队列，最终服务不可用。Eric Allman 已在 Sendmail 8.10.0 版本中修复此漏洞，建议升级至 8.10.0 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1109"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"1999-12-22T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:44Z","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 至 8.10.0 或更高版本（如 8.15.2），或在 sendmail.mc 中添加 `FEATURE(\\`no_etrn\\')` 禁用 ETRN 命令，重新编译 sendmail.cf 后重启 sendmail 服务；若无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制 25 端口仅允许可信 IP 访问，或在 /etc/mail/access 中添加 `ETRN RELAY` 限制 ETRN 命令来源 IP。\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94632241202626&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94780566911948&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7760.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/904","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19701","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1109.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1109","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-1999-1109.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1109.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jw39-vxm9-j3xr/GHSA-jw39-vxm9-j3xr.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/sendmail_etrn_dos.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1109.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0949.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0919","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0919.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1066","title":"id Software Quake 1 服务器 UDP 反射放大漏洞","description":"Quake 1 游戏服务器在处理初始 UDP 游戏连接请求时，会以大量流量数据包进行回应，存在流量放大攻击漏洞。远程攻击者通过伪造源 IP 地址发送特制的 UDP 连接请求，可诱使服务器向目标主机发送大量响应数据，从而实现类似 Smurf 攻击的分布式拒绝服务放大效果。该漏洞影响 Quake 1 服务器软件，CVSS 评分 5.0，攻击者无需认证即可利用，被放大后的流量可耗尽目标带宽资源。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1066"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-22T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:38Z","remediation":"建议升级至 QuakeWorld 或 FTE QuakeWorld 等现代引擎版本，其已修复放大攻击漏洞。若无法升级，在网络边界配置入向 ACL 过滤伪造源 IP 的数据包（BCP 38），并对 UDP 26000 端口实施速率限制以缓解攻击影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94589559631535&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1066.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1066","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1066.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c1321b1a6b0cb3a4c18f791e2c8443742c0cb0b0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1066.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x4qc-6r3x-7rp4/GHSA-x4qc-6r3x-7rp4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1066.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_100_200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000954.txt","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/CWE-Expert/blob/f634e911e6c24a1ad8b9619383e2ab3eb2d9ebd4/CWE_corpus/markdown/4_cwe_trimmed_top25.md.txt","https://github.com/ws-researcher/CAEA/blob/098ddb07c83845feda3d1b1d56ef634927954af4/KGA/dataSet/ICNS/entN_ids_1"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0919.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1136","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1136.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1497","title":"Ipswitch IMail Server 弱加密存储密码致本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"IPSwitch IMail Server 5.0 及 6.0 版本使用弱加密算法将电子邮件账户密码存储在注册表键值中，本地攻击者可通过读取注册表项解密获取明文密码，进而未授权访问目标邮件系统。该漏洞影响 IPSwitch IMail Server 多版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。厂商已发布更新版本修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1497"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:34Z","remediation":"升级至 Ipswitch IMail 7.0 及以上版本，该版本改用强加密算法保存邮箱账户密码。临时缓解措施：使用 regedit 或组策略，将注册表项 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Ipswitch\\IMail 的权限设置为仅允许管理员读取，阻止普通本地用户访问密码数据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/39329","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/880","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/401","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/453c5421de2e86e7c24435e1e7daaae43fb314cf/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1497.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1497","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1497.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9a5386d000a40888283d918a46b8928ffcbfca7b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1497.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9abbad74b022844878ae09855eadd45809145d9b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q3wh-6m92-8378/GHSA-q3wh-6m92-8378.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/1999.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c03e0907-d5cc-47e9-98e0-ff958071bda0.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000948.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1497.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1136.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1136.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1136.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1682","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1682.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0997","title":"WU-FTPD FTP Conversion 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"WU-FTPD 的 FTP 转换功能在处理恶意构造的文件名时存在命令注入漏洞。当 FTP 转换（如 tar 或 uncompress）功能启用时，攻击者可通过上传包含特殊字符的畸形文件名，使其被作为参数传递给外部转换程序，从而在目标服务器上以 FTP 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 WU-FTPD 2.4.2 至 2.6.2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0997"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-12-20T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 WU-FTPD 至 2.6.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复文件名参数注入漏洞。如无法升级，在 ftpaccess 配置文件中将 conversion 功能设为 no 以禁用自动转换功能，或迁移至 vsftpd 或 ProFTPD 等更安全的替代 FTP 服务端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-377"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1682.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0852","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0852.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1006","title":"Groupwise 企业级邮件系统 Web 服务器 GWWEB.EXE 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Groupwise 企业级邮件系统 Web 服务器 GWWEB.EXE 存在路径遍历漏洞，攻击者可远程访问 HELP 参数获取服务器的内部路径结构，并读取位于 Web 根目录之外的 .htm 文件。该漏洞源于应用程序泄露绝对文件系统路径信息，缺乏对 HELP 异步的充分访问控制。攻击者可通过构造恶意请求枚举服务器目录结构，进而访问服务器之外的敏感文件。该漏洞已在 GroupWise 5.2 和 5.5 版本中被证实，影响范围涵盖该邮件系统的 Web 界面帮助功能。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1006"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:30Z","remediation":"建议升级 Novell GroupWise 到已修复该路径遍历问题的官方版本（GroupWise 5.5 EP 及以上），并应用 Novell 发布的对应 Support Pack 补丁。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理或 WAF 规则过滤 HELP 参数中的 \"../\"、绝对路径等遍历字符，并禁用或限制 GWWEB.EXE 对敏感目录的访问，仅开放必要虚拟路径作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94571433731824&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b8f7915616bad1c7280e28216588ab0258074928/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1006.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1006","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1006.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ea13d8ca97b52327fe351b64da51866911834231/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1006.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/424512debdca84cc53ffa1fb3810a74f7b1905a5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j6r8-2wq6-f58q/GHSA-j6r8-2wq6-f58q.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/groupwise_web_interface_help_hole.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1006.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000946.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--66e530a7-b849-4eeb-881d-b8c411c494b7.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0852.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0850","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0850.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1005","title":"Novell GroupWise 5.2/5.5 GWWEB.EXE 目录遍历与路径泄露漏洞","description":"Novell GroupWise 5.2 和 5.5 版本的 Web 接口组件 GWWEB.EXE 存在两个安全缺陷。首先，HELP 参数会向客户端返回服务器完整文件系统路径，泄露敏感的内部目录结构信息。其次，攻击者通过在 HELP 参数中注入 '../' 目录遍历序列，可绕过访问控制读取服务器上任意位置的 .htm 文件或浏览目录内容。此外，向 GWWEB.EXE 发送超长字符串可触发 GWINTER.NLM 的缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需向目标服务器发送构造的 HTTP 请求即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1005"],"sources":["cve","bugtraq","exploit-db"],"published":"1999-12-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Novell GroupWise 5.5 后续支持包或更高版本，修复 GWWEB.EXE 的目录遍历与缓冲区溢出缺陷。若无法立即升级，应在 Netscape Enterprise Server 或前端代理中配置 URL 过滤规则，拦截 HELP 参数中包含 '../' 或 '..' 的请求，并将 GWWEB.EXE 进程权限限制在其 Web 根目录范围内，禁止越权访问其他文件系统路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94571433731824&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/3413","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/879","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19682"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19682"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0850.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0850.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0850.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1680","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1680.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0995","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Local Security Authority 子系统 LsaLookupSids 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 的本地安全权威子系统（LSA）在处理 LsaLookupSids 函数调用时存在输入验证缺陷（CWE-20）。该函数用于根据安全标识符（SID）查找对应的账户信息，但远程攻击者可通过构造畸形、格式不正确的 SID 参数发起请求。由于 LSA 未对传入参数进行充分校验，接收到畸形 SID 后会导致 Local Security Authority Subsystem Service 进程异常崩溃，进而引发目标系统拒绝服务，需重启才能恢复。该漏洞影响运行 Windows NT 4.0 的远程主机，攻击者可未经身份认证通过网络远程触发，无需本地登录权限或用户交互，利用方式即向目标发送包含畸形 SID 参数的 LsaLookupSids 请求。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0995"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:29Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 发布的安全补丁 KB248185，该修复已包含在 MS99-056（Syskey Keystream Reuse）公告的补丁包中。受影响系统包括 Windows NT Workstation 4.0、Windows NT Server 4.0、Windows NT Server 4.0 Enterprise Edition 以及 Windows NT Server 4.0 Terminal Server Edition。已应用 MS99-056 补丁的用户无需额外操作。如短期内无法安装补丁，可在边界防火墙上封锁 NetBIOS 及 TCP 445 端口的访问，以阻断远程攻击者向 LSA 发送畸形 SID 请求的路径。由于 Windows NT 4.0 已停止支持，长期缓解措施为将系统升级至受支持的 Windows 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ248185","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/875","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-057","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-0995.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf63c766a0e51c24a528a42a3e26e4fdf58db9e8/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0995.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0995","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/08f8d33c39c79a3a93a8b5c441facde3f9e3cc7d/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0995.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0995.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f43f79d7ee652229af6058b1c98133bb5bbc17fb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m7p3-89hq-9rch/GHSA-m7p3-89hq-9rch.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153800_153900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fce51a26-ebf8-401d-911b-712877e4db93.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1680.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0837","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0837.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1001","title":"思科 缓存引擎 基于NULL凭证的认证绕过漏洞","description":"思科缓存引擎（Cisco Cache Engine）在处理用户访问认证时存在访问验证缺陷，未对登录凭据进行严格校验。远程攻击者可在认证请求中提交空的用户名与密码（null username and password），绕过正常的身份验证机制，从而未经授权访问受保护的缓存服务或管理功能。该漏洞影响运行相关版本软件的思科缓存引擎设备，攻击无需本地权限，仅需网络可达并能够发起认证请求即可利用，危害程度中等，可能导致缓存内容被非法访问或设备配置被未授权操作。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1001"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:29Z","remediation":"将 Cisco Cache Engine 升级至修复该空凭证认证绕过问题的官方固件版本（具体版本号以 Cisco 安全公告为准），并在无法立即升级时，于边界防火墙或访问控制列表（ACL）上限制仅允许受信任管理网段访问设备的管理端口，同时禁用匿名/空用户名空密码登录并强制配置强口令认证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-1001","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-1001.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/786262dea273b0bddfc7eb6f6950f11b9f01c05c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1001.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1001","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/165075bb4c3675993ac058501ff8575bd07a9ca0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1001.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1001.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f43f79d7ee652229af6058b1c98133bb5bbc17fb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jw6g-mwcg-w65v/GHSA-jw6g-mwcg-w65v.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1001.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87020/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153800_153900.json","https://github.com/lgp171188/launchpad/blob/eafda459366f2c43246e9c4fa98b8c008434bb68/lib/lp/bugs/scripts/cveimport.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0837.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0837.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0833","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0833.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1000","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9116,\"outputTokens\":17,\"totalTokens\":10797}}","description":"Cisco Cache Engine 的 Web 管理界面存在信息泄露漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接访问管理界面的性能统计页面，无需认证即可查看设备的性能统计信息，包括缓存命中率、流量统计、系统资源使用等敏感运行数据。该漏洞影响 Cisco Cache Engine 多个版本，攻击者仅需通过网络访问管理界面的特定 URL 路径即可获取敏感性能数据，无需任何身份认证或特殊权限。攻击者可利用泄露的性能统计信息分析设备负载情况、网络流量模式及系统配置，为后续攻击提供情报支持。Cisco 已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议升级到修复版本并限制管理界面的网络访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1000"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:29Z","remediation":"建议升级 Cisco Cache Engine 至厂商修复后的软件版本（如 ACNS 4.x 或更高版本）。同时应对 Web 管理界面配置访问控制列表（ACL），仅允许受信任的管理网段访问；关闭或限制未授权用户对性能统计页面的访问，并为管理界面启用强身份认证。如无法立即升级，可在边界防火墙上限制对 Cache Engine 管理端口（如 TCP 8001/8888）的外部访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-1000","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-1000.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/786262dea273b0bddfc7eb6f6950f11b9f01c05c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1000.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1000","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/165075bb4c3675993ac058501ff8575bd07a9ca0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1000.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f43f79d7ee652229af6058b1c98133bb5bbc17fb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6xm7-wpgr-j445/GHSA-6xm7-wpgr-j445.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1000.json","https://github.com/GiovanniMenon/llm4cve/blob/3ca85b2ae823c06810c546f320c2cd2f2707043f/README.md","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--82f3f412-fe84-463c-a838-96c287166f4d.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0833.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0833.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0830","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0830.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0998","title":"思科 缓存引擎 缓存内容替换漏洞","description":"思科（Cisco）Cache Engine 缓存引擎存在安全漏洞，攻击者能够向缓存引擎发送特制的请求，将缓存中已存储的合法 Web 内容替换为攻击者控制的恶意内容。该漏洞影响部署了 Cisco Cache Engine 并对用户 Web 访问进行内容缓存的网络环境，攻击者可借此实施内容篡改、钓鱼或投毒等中间人式攻击。利用该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击者只需能够与目标缓存引擎进行网络通信，即可注入伪造的缓存响应，使后续访问该内容的用户获取被篡改的数据。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0998"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:29Z","remediation":"建议将 Cisco Cache Engine 升级至修复该漏洞的官方固件版本（具体版本号参见 Cisco 安全公告），并及时应用 Cisco 发布的相关软件更新。如暂无法升级，可在上游边界设备配置访问控制列表（ACL）仅允许受信任源站回源，禁止未经授权的外部主机向缓存引擎推送或替换内容，同时在缓存引擎上启用内容完整性校验与来源认证，限制管理接口仅对内部网络开放，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0998","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-0998.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf63c766a0e51c24a528a42a3e26e4fdf58db9e8/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0998.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0998","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/08f8d33c39c79a3a93a8b5c441facde3f9e3cc7d/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0998.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0998.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f43f79d7ee652229af6058b1c98133bb5bbc17fb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cp4f-jgpj-pg53/GHSA-cp4f-jgpj-pg53.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0998.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87024/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153800_153900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0830.toml"}]